OL,3,ABurnham rules out early general
OL,4,Aelection in next 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has ruled out an early
OL,7,Fgeneral election in the next 12 months,
OL,8,Fafter opposition parties suggested one
OL,9,Fwould be called.
OL,11,FThe next UK general election must be
OL,12,Fheld by August 2029, and there has been
OL,13,Fspeculation that the prime minister is
OL,14,Fpreparing for an earlier poll.
OL,16,FAsked directly if he would call a snap
OL,17,Felection within the next year, the
OL,18,Fprime minister told broadcasters: "I
OL,19,Fdon't know how many times I've done
OL,20,Fthis now but yes, I can rule out
OL,21,Fcalling a general election in the next
OL,22,F12 months."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
