OL,3,ABurnham rules out early general
OL,4,Aelection in next 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was focusing on people over
OL,7,Fthe Labour Party, adding: "I'm not
OL,8,Fthinking about myself. I'm not thinking
OL,9,Fabout my own party and its prospects."
